{"id":"word:hebrew:H5678","type":"word","title":"עֶבְרָה","subtitle":"H5678 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"an outburst of passion","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֶבְרָה (H5678) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 34 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֶבְרָה (ʻebrâh) means an outburst of passion First listed occurrence: Amos 1 11."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֶבְרָה","transliteration":"ʻebrâh","pronunciation":"eb-raw'","strong":"H5678","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5678","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["עֶבְרָתִ֖/י","וְ/עֶבְרָת֖/וֹ","עֶבְרַ֣ת","עֶבְרָתֶ֑/ךָ","עֶבְרָתֽ/וֹ"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",6],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",4],["HNcfsa",4],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",3],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",3],["HR/Ncfsc",3],["HNcfsc",2],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cs",1],["HC/Ncfsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"an outburst of passion","usage":"anger, rage, wrath.","full":"H5678. ebrah עֶבְרָה noun feminine overflow, arrogance, fury ; — absolute ׳ע Isa 13:9 +; construct עֶבְרַת Zeph 1:18 +; suffix עֶבְרָתִי Isa 10:6 +, etc.; plural עֲבָרוֺת Job 21:30 ; construct עַבְרוֺת Psa 7:7 ; Job 40:11 ; &#8212; 1 overflow, excess, outburst , ׳ע זָדוֺן Prov 21:24 excess of insolence ; אַמֶּ֑ךָ עַבְרוֺת Job 40:11 outbursts of thine anger . 2 arrogance , of Moab Isa 16:6 ( + גַּאֲוָה ), גַּא׃ן hence Jer 48:20 (+ id. 48:29 ). 3 overflowing rage, fury: a. of men , Gen 49:7 (poem in J), Amos 1:11 (both || אַף ), Isa 14:6 ; Prov 14:35 , עֶבְרָתוֺ שֵׁבֶט 22:8 (i. e. rod wielded by him in fury, see also Lam 3:1 below), צוֺרְרָ֑י עַבְרוֺת Psa 7:7 the outbursts of fury of my foes b. of ׳י Hosea 5:10 ; 13:11 (|| אַף ), Hab 3:8 (|| id. ), Isa 9:18 ; Lam 2:2 ; Psa 90:9 ; 90:11 ; + אַף חֲרן Isa 13:9 , || id. 13:13 ; Psa 78:49 (+ זַעַם ), 85:4 ; עֶבְרָתִי אֵשׁ Ezekiel 21:36 (|| זַעַם ), Ezek 22:31 (|| id. ), 22:21 ; 38:19 ; עֶבְרָתוֺ שֵׁבֶט Lam 3:1 (compare Prov 22:8 above); עֶבְרָתִי עַם Isa 10:6 (i.e. object of my rage), compare עֶבְרָתוֺ דּוֺר Jer 7:29 ; י עֶבְרַת ׳יוֺם Zeph 1:18 day of ׳י 's fury (coming judgment), so Ezek 7:19 (strike out Co Berthol, after ᵐ5 , as gloss from Zephaniah); so עֶבְרָה יוֺם Zeph 1:15 ; Prov 11:4 ; עֲבָרוֺת יוֺם Job 21:30 ; compare עֶבְרָה Prov 11:23 .","rootNote":"feminine of 5676 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Amos 1 11","keyReferences":["Amos 1 11","Ezek 7 19","Ezek 21 36","Ezek 22 21","Ezek 22 31","Ezek 38 19","Gen 49 7","Hab 3 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":34,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Amos 1 11","book":"Amos","chapter":1,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/עֶבְרָת֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Ezek 7 19","book":"Ezek","chapter":7,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶבְרַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 21 36","book":"Ezek","chapter":21,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶבְרָתִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Ezek 22 21","book":"Ezek","chapter":22,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶבְרָתִ֑/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Ezek 22 31","book":"Ezek","chapter":22,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶבְרָתִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Ezek 38 19","book":"Ezek","chapter":38,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶבְרָתִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Gen 49 7","book":"Gen","chapter":49,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/עֶבְרָתָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Hab 3 8","book":"Hab","chapter":3,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶבְרָתֶ֑/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Hos 5 10","book":"Hos","chapter":5,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶבְרָתִֽ/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HN